{"arrivo":"en","origine":"as","origine_nome":"Assamese","n":24,"n_alternative":0,"parole":[{"parola":"Ahom","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"A member of a Kra-Dai ethnic group in northeastern India.","termine_origine":"আহোম","termine_origine_traslitterazione":"ahüm","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"আহোম","traslitterazione":"ahüm","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"as","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from Assamese আহোম (ahüm)."},{"parola":"basha","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"A tarpaulin or plastic waterproof sheet.","termine_origine":"","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"as","ambiti":["militare","sport","diritto_politica"],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from Assamese [Term?]."},{"parola":"bhut jolokia","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"A kind of very spicy hot chili pepper from India.","termine_origine":"ভোট-জলকীয়া","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"ভোট-জলকীয়া","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"as","ambiti":["cucina"],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from Assamese ভোট-জলকীয়া (bhüt-zolokia, literally “Bhutanese chili”) or ভূত-জলকীয়া (bhut-zolokia, literally “ghost chili”)."},{"parola":"gamosa","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"A rectangular cloth, typically of red and white, used in a variety of ritual actions in Assamese culture.","termine_origine":"গামোচা","termine_origine_traslitterazione":"gamüsa","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"গামোচা","traslitterazione":"gamüsa","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"as","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Borrowed from Assamese গামোচা (gamüsa)."},{"parola":"ghost chili","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"calco","incerta":"no","significato":"Synonym of bhut jolokia.","termine_origine":"ভোট-জলকীয়া","termine_origine_traslitterazione":"bhüt-zolokia","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"ভোট-জলকীয়া","traslitterazione":"bhüt-zolokia","categoria":"calco"}],"lontana":"as","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Calque of Assamese ভোট-জলকীয়া (bhüt-zolokia, literally “Bhutanese chili”). The first element bhüt, meaning Bhutanese, was mistakenly confused for near-homonym ভূত (bhut) meaning ghost, thus producing the English (mis-)translation “ghost pepper”."},{"parola":"ghost chili pepper","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"calco","incerta":"no","significato":"Synonym of bhut jolokia.","termine_origine":"ভূত-জলকীয়া","termine_origine_traslitterazione":"bhut-zolokia","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"ভূত-জলকীয়া","traslitterazione":"bhut-zolokia","categoria":"calco"}],"lontana":"as","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From ghost + chili pepper. Calque of Assamese ভূত-জলকীয়া (bhut-zolokia, “Ghost chili”), based on a misunderstanding of Assamese ভোট-জলকীয়া (bhüt-zolokia, “Bhutanese chili”)."},{"parola":"ghost pepper","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"calco","incerta":"no","significato":"Synonym of bhut jolokia.","termine_origine":"ভোট-জলকীয়া","termine_origine_traslitterazione":"bhüt-zolokia","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"ভোট-জলকীয়া","traslitterazione":"bhüt-zolokia","categoria":"calco"}],"lontana":"as","ambiti":["cucina"],"via":"","testo":"Calque of Assamese ভোট-জলকীয়া (bhüt-zolokia, “Bhutanese chili”). The first element ভোট (bhüt, “Bhutanese”) was mistakenly confused for the near-homonym ভূত (bhut, “ghost”), thus producing the English (mis-)translation \"ghost pepper\"."},{"parola":"Hazarika","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"prestito","incerta":"no","significato":"an officer appointed as head of a thousand soldiers during Ahom rule in Assam","termine_origine":"হাজৰিকা","termine_origine_traslitterazione":"hazorika","catena":[{"codice":"as","nome":"Assamese","termine":"হাজৰিকা","traslitterazione":"hazorika","